    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n105546" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τροφ-εῖα</span></b> , τά, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>pay for rearing and bringing up,
